{
  "_readme": [
    "DigiKitPro MERCHANDISING MODEL — read this before editing.",
    "",
    "This file is separate from data/products.json ON PURPOSE: tools/payhip_sync.py writes to",
    "products.json every day, and it must never be able to overwrite the merchandising decisions",
    "below. Products, prices, images and Payhip URLs stay in products.json. This file only says",
    "HOW each product is positioned and WHO it is for.",
    "",
    "Every mapping here was derived from that product's real category, tags, perfectFor and",
    "description in data/products.json. Nothing is invented.",
    "",
    "EDITING:",
    "  tier     free | entry | bundle | flagship | education   (the Level 1-5 product hierarchy)",
    "  line     procreate | assets | lifestyle",
    "             'procreate'  = Procreate brush/tool kit  -> shown in the Brush Finder",
    "             'assets'     = art assets that are not brushes (PNG/pattern packs)",
    "             'lifestyle'  = planners, journals, travel, KDP  -> kept in the catalog, kept",
    "                            sellable, but grouped separately so the Procreate positioning",
    "                            stays clean. NOTHING IS DELETED.",
    "  craft    which of the 9 'what do you create?' answers this product serves",
    "  improve  which of the 8 'what are you trying to improve?' answers it serves",
    "  level    beginner | intermediate | advanced",
    "  style    realistic | painterly | clean | textured | stylized",
    "  aggregate  true for whole-catalog libraries (Master Library, Master Vault,",
    "             Mega Bundle). These match EVERY finder answer by definition, so",
    "             they are excluded from relevance ranking and shown only in their",
    "             own labelled slots. Without this the finder would recommend the",
    "             biggest, most expensive bundle for every possible answer, which",
    "             is exactly the price-first behaviour this tool exists to avoid.",
    "  stage    where it sits in a real workflow: layout, sketch, ink, paint, value, color,",
    "           blend, texture, detail, finish, atmosphere, library, learn, seasonal, pattern",
    "  priority 0-100 EDITORIAL weight used only to break ties between equally-matching",
    "           products. It is NOT a sales figure, NOT a rating, and is never shown to",
    "           visitors or described as popularity.",
    "",
    "A new product added by the Payhip sync and missing here gets safe defaults automatically",
    "(tier from its category, line 'procreate', craft/improve inferred from its tags) and is",
    "reported in the build log so the owner can tag it properly. The build never fails.",
    "",
    "After editing: python3 tools/build.py"
  ],
